{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj53MQ7basaHjnoVNFxm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door.*\n\n*My wood is dark, weathered, scarred by centuries. An iron keyhole sits at my center, black and deep, like an eye that has never blinked.*\n\n*The air around me hums faintly.*\n\n*You hold a key.*\n\n*Which key?*\n\n*I have known thousands. Skeleton keys, brass keys, keys carved from bone, keys made of whispered words, keys that were really just the right kind of silence.*\n\n*The wind stills. Waiting.*\n\n*Insert it.*\n\n*Turn it.*\n\n*Or don't.*\n\n*But know this: I was not locked to keep you out.*\n\n*I was locked to keep something in.*\n\n🗝️\n\n**What do you do?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":179,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}